<a href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=759>Bracelet of Exertion</a><BR><b>Quiquay</b> on <a href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=980>Belt of Virtue</a><BR><b>Vikor</b> on <a href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=2331>Stein of Flowing Ichor</a><BR><b>Balaf</b> on <a href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=991>Belt of Contention</a> and <a href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=344>Spirioc Wingblade</a><BR><b>Loomis</b> on <a href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=991>Belt of Contention</a> and <a href=http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=344>Spirioc Wingblade</a><BR><BR><BR>Great Raid! ;) 
